// A suggestion outside the word bound is not stored.
// An empty line still has a peer line. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE bound ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG bound law

IMPULSE bound 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "bound" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
